ue pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">$39.8/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">$49.821/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.51.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 1st, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description.\">Description.</span></h2>\n<p>Plek is a variation of kelp which can be found in the river caves.\n</p><p><b>Requires a <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Axe\" title=\"Refined Axe\">Refined Axe</a> or greater.</b>\n</p><p><b>Requires a <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Scooba_Tank\" title=\"Refined Scooba Tank\">Refined Scooba Tank</a>.</b>\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</span></h2>\n<p>Plek is located deep inside of the River Caves. It is accessible of one route as of 2024.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Go into the magma caves and pass the magma trees</li>\n<li>Go left instead of the usual straight or right for magmite</li>\n<li>Fall off and go to the bottom where the magma is (You can also follow a certain route that is very complex and is the way you will haft to take up regardless)</li>\n<li>Once you fall off, press V and travel further down the cave whilst navigating over magma as fast as possible</li>\n<li>You have made it to the cave!</li></ul>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bFyZSnyHwaQ\">YOUTUBE VIDEO</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Textures\">Textures</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"a9dc1d059a6bc91b01fe684274265cd0\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\">N/A</div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:1002px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:211px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Barkedplek-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:209px; width:209px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Barkedplek.png\" title=\"Barkedplek.png (51 KB)\" style=\"height:209px; width:209px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/27/Barkedplek.png/revision/latest?cb=20240326131212\" title=\"Barkedplek.png (51 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Log\" height=\"209\" width=\"209\" data-image-name=\"Barkedplek.png\" data-image-key=\"Barkedplek.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Log\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Barkedplek.png (51 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Log\" height=\"209\" width=\"209\" data-image-name=\"Barkedplek.png\" data-image-key=\"Barkedplek.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Log\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/27/Barkedplek.png/revision/latest?cb=20240326131212\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:1000px;\">Log</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:1002px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:211px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Sandedplek-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:203px; width:204px; top:3px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Sandedplek.png\" title=\"Sandedplek.png (91 KB)\" style=\"height:203px; width:204px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/87/Sandedplek.png/revision/latest?cb=20240326131228\" title=\"Sandedplek.png (91 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Sanded\" height=\"203\" width=\"204\" data-image-name=\"Sandedplek.png\" data-image-key=\"Sandedplek.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Sanded\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Sandedplek.png (91 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Sanded\" height=\"203\" width=\"204\" data-image-name=\"Sandedplek.png\" data-image-key=\"Sandedplek.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Sanded\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/87/Sandedplek.png/revision/latest?cb=20240326131228\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:1000px;\">Sanded</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:1002px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:211px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Plankedplek-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:208px; width:208px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Plankedplek.png\" title=\"Plankedplek.png (72 KB)\" style=\"height:208px; width:208px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ee/Plankedplek.png/revision/latest?cb=20240326131243\" title=\"Plankedplek.png (72 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Planked\" height=\"208\" width=\"208\" data-image-name=\"Plankedplek.png\" data-image-key=\"Plankedplek.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Planked\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Plankedplek.png (72 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Planked\" height=\"208\" width=\"208\" data-image-name=\"Plankedplek.png\" data-image-key=\"Plankedplek.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Planked\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ee/Plankedplek.png/revision/latest?cb=20240326131243\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:1000px;\">Planked</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Plek is the first tree in the game to be translucent.</li>\n<li>surprisingly, to how <a href=\"/wiki/Oobmab\" title=\"Oobmab\">Oobmab</a> was named, Plek is actually not like <a href=\"/wiki/Kelp\" title=\"Kelp\">Kelp</a> spelled in reverse.</li>\n<li>Plek shares some similarities with <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://lumber-tycoon-2.fandom.com/wiki/Cavecrawler_Wood\">Cavecrawler Wood</a> from <i><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.roblox.com/games/13822889/Lumber-Tycoon-2\">Lumber Tycoon 2</a></i>, such as being located in a maze, and having a similar color scheme.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Plek (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6UGxlaz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></span> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer 